  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "My seat trigger colliders are inside of a physical hull collider. The hull is on a custom layer called PhysicCollider and I use the \"Interact Passthrough\" setting to make it transparent to interaction. Live I can interact with the seats. That was uploaded with SDK 3.5.0. But when I upload my world with SDK 3.6.0, the interaction isn't possible anymore. I have to crawl to reach the seat collider inside. I guess, that feature broke with the layer changes in SDK 3.6.0. The first two images shows live SDK 3.5.0 vs my testworld SDK 3.6.0.",
